---
description: Shared journal invariants and safe delivery workflow
alwaysApply: true
---

- Read and follow AGENTS.md and CONTRIBUTING.md.
- Preserve Classic, Legacy, backend, data keys, migrations and Site identity.
- One canonical trade ledger, cashflow ledger, RiskMath and RiskStore.
- Never infer missing fees or 1R; require explicit verification for risk statistics.
- Preserve origins and the no-mock lock after clearing sample data.
- Download and verify JSON before destructive actions; use synthetic fixtures.
- Work on a feature branch; no direct main writes, force-push or merge without human approval.
- Run npm run ci:check before proposing a PR; report actual results and unresolved limits.
